    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2M5FHBGEC6d1UzpeMBKm52V)_\n\n## What\n`M-x sp-load-config-file` is `load-file` rooted at the configuration folder (`sp-load-path`). It lists every `.el` file below it, relative to the folder, and completes on them (category `file`, so Marginalia and Embark work), then loads the chosen one. No need to type the path.\n\nThe search is `directory-files-recursively`, not a shell tool, and skips `elpaca`, `eln-cache`, `backups`, `auto-save-list`, `.git`, `var` and `url` (`sp-load-config-file-excluded`).\n\nIt lives in `sp-navi` next to `sp-find-file`; the literate doc (`sp-navi.org`) and CHANGELOG are updated. No key binding added.\n\n## Not tested\nNothing was run in Emacs (none in the container).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9HynvWV7CVj5Bz71W)_",
